  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Les zones sauvages sont un vrai don du ciel !\nJ’y passe mes journées à capturer des Magicarpe.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Regarde, j’en ai capturé un gigantesque !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEt j’exagère même pas ! Tu vois, c’est marqué\ndans son résumé : « taille XL » !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 129
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Même son attaque Trempette est de taille XL !\nMon gaillard vit la vie en grand, j’te l’dis !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 692,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’parie même qu’on trouvera jamais\nun Magicarpe plus grand qu’lui !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A2019007000610072006900650020006D00EA006D00650020007100752019006F006E002000740072006F007500760065007200610020006A0061006D006100690073000A0075006E0020004D0061006700690063006100720070006500200070006C007500730020006700720061006E00640020007100752019006C0075006900200021001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 72
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Parce que sinon... j’aimerais vraiment, mais\nalors vraiment de chez vraiment voir la bestiole.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 1032,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Enfin, il paraît qu’on aurait vu un Magicarpe\nénormissime dans la zone sauvage nº 2...<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nMais c’est qu’une rumeur, moi j’y crois pas.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 139
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "T’as capturé un Magicarpe encore plus grand\nqu’le mien ? Prouve-le !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054201900610073002000630061007000740075007200E900200075006E0020004D0061006700690063006100720070006500200065006E0063006F0072006500200070006C007500730020006700720061006E0064000A007100752019006C00650020006D00690065006E0020003F002000500072006F007500760065002D006C006500200021001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 73
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Aucun Magicarpe n’est plus grand qu’le mien !\nCe sera vrai jusqu’à preuve du contraire !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu plaisantes ? Il lui arrive même pas à\nla nageoire !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054007500200070006C0061006900730061006E0074006500730020003F00200049006C0020006C0075006900200061007200720069007600650020006D00EA006D00650020007000610073002000E0000A006C00610020006E006100670065006F00690072006500200021001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je savais que c’était impossible ! Mon Magicarpe\nest le plus grand du monde ! Mouahaha !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 93
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Une petite minute !\nCe Magicarpe est carrément énorme !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0055006E006500200070006500740069007400650020006D0069006E00750074006500200021000A004300650020004D0061006700690063006100720070006500200065007300740020006300610072007200E9006D0065006E0074002000E9006E006F0072006D006500200021001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais mon œil d’expert me dit que le mien est\nplus grand d’un bon gros millimètre !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Non mais c’est quoi ce monstre ?!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2464,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F006E0020006D006100690073002000632019006500730074002000710075006F00690020006300650020006D006F006E00730074007200650020003F0021001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hein ? Un Baron, tu dis ?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2540,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004800650069006E0020003F00200055006E0020004200610072006F006E002C00200074007500200064006900730020003F001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Genre, il a un titre de noblesse, le bestiau ?!\nMais... C’est pas juste !!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2600,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On va pas s’laisser faire !!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006E0020007600610020007000610073002000732019006C0061006900730073006500720020006600610069007200650020002100210021001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "La valeur d’un Magicarpe se mesure à la hauteur\nd’ses sauts avec Trempette ! Tout l’monde le sait !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vas-y, Magicarpe ! Montre-lui ce qu’est\nun saut de Trempette de taille XL !!!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 3036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est... si... haut...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00432019006500730074002E002E002E002000730069002E002E002E00200068006100750074002E002E002E001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bon, ben... J’crois qu’on a perdu...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3256,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006F006E002C002000620065006E002E002E002E0020004A201900630072006F006900730020007100752019006F006E00200061002000700065007200640075002E002E002E001000020114013D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’pensais que sa giga taille serait un handicap\npour sauter, mais c’est l’inverse...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu disais que c’était un « Baron », c’est ça ?\nHmmm... OK, c’est décidé ! Tu m’as inspiré !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3520,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’vais capturer toute une armée de Magicarpe\ngéants ! En avant toute pour la zone sauvage nº 2 !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 101
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’continuerai ma quête jusqu’à ce que je trouve\nmon propre Magicarpe Baron !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3928,
